cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use synthpriv in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "synthpriv: tabular data synthesis preserving differential privacy"
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-09-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tzinny-dev/synthpriv"
url: "https://tzinny-dev.github.io/synthpriv/"
keywords:
  - differential-privacy
  - synthetic-data
  - tabular-data
  - data-synthesis
  - privacy
authors:
  - given-names: Carlos
    email: 921charly@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  Library and command-line tool for tabular data synthesis with a formal
  differential-privacy guarantee: DP-SGD GAN (dp-gan), private Gaussian copula
  (dp-copula), DP marginal ECDFs, privacy/utility metrics, budget sweep,
  benchmark and self-contained HTML reports.
